<title>LATVIA: UNIBANKA SLIPS, DAUGAVPILS SLIDES ON BOURSE.</title>
<headline>UNIBANKA SLIPS, DAUGAVPILS SLIDES ON BOURSE.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unibanka fell to 3.31 lats form 3.51</p>
<p>lats amid quiet trade on Friday at the morning price fix.</p>
<p>Daugavpils Chain also lost heavily, down to 1.17 lats from</p>
<p>2.15 lats, but the reason was technical as shares from a bonus</p>
<p>issue hit the market.</p>
<p>Only 13 stocks were traded and prices were mixed to lower.</p>
<p>Other shares can be bought (B) or sold (S) at the following</p>
<p>prices and in the following volume, the bourse said in a</p>
<p>statement.</p>
